        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "希望呢，能够摆脱这种亚健康状态。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.207,
      "end": 20.428,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那哪子才能够随时随地的投入去健身活动当中呢？",
      "score": 0.159,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0484,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0449,
        "sc_delta": 0.0034,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.072,
        "seg_cer": 0.048,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 1.0,
        "phon_examples": "子/只",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那哪只才能够随时随地的投入去健身活动当中呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.428,
      "end": 27.018,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我们一起了解一下。首先呢，就要端正心态，莫给自己设立一个太高的门槛。",
      "score": 0.061,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
